01:16:21.322 --> 01:16:22.685
What's your name?


01:16:29.382 --> 01:16:30.868
I forgot.


01:16:47.876 --> 01:16:49.149
Yes?


01:16:57.303 --> 01:16:59.484
- Witkoff.
- Jim, I am.


01:17:00.545 --> 01:17:03.228
We should meet to discuss
events of today. Are you hungry?


01:17:32.290 --> 01:17:34.109
Alex.


01:17:43.845 --> 01:17:46.147
Do not forget to turn off the lights.


01:17:55.990 --> 01:17:57.688
No, I can not.


01:17:58.354 --> 01:18:01.202
- I must return to the Company later.
- Well, enjoy the paperwork.


01:18:02.574 --> 01:18:04.392
You miss fewer in Mexico.


01:18:05.362 --> 01:18:07.151
Do you really think that we can escape?


01:18:07.787 --> 01:18:09.946
The way is cleared.


01:18:15.128 --> 01:18:18.037
I do not remember the last time
I saw you outside the agency.


01:18:21.554 --> 01:18:23.800
We should have done it more often.


01:18:36.437 --> 01:18:38.619
What a low, Rick.


01:18:41.710 --> 01:18:46.410
Sorry, Jimmy. Do not deal with. I ask.


01:18:47.227 --> 01:18:49.500
It's the least we can do.


01:19:21.772 --> 01:19:25.772
Well, Jane, now that we are
partners we will divide as it should.


01:19:36.886 --> 01:19:38.857
My name is Sarah.

